CardDescriptionm = "\"When you play Green Mushroom from your hand to an empty Party Slot, you may place a Buff Counter or Nerf Counter on it.At the beginning of your Planning Step, if Green Mushroom has more Buff Counters than Nerf Counters, it gives a Buff Counter to each other Adventurer in your Party. If it doesn't, it gives a Nerf Counter to each other Adventurer in your Party instead.\""
